cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. If NiriZan has an associated paper by the time you are citing it, prefer that citation instead; check the repository for a preferred-citation entry or a linked publication."
type: software
title: "NiriZan"
abstract: >
  NiriZan is an open-source continuous evaluation infrastructure for
  production AI systems. It enables engineers and researchers to
  systematically measure, benchmark, validate, and monitor the quality of
  Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) pipelines, AI agents, Large Language
  Model (LLM) applications, and custom AI workflows, treating evaluation as
  a continuous, reproducible engineering discipline rather than a one-time
  pre-release check.
authors:
